// artful — a stand-in for Metal's standard library, for clang++ -fsyntax-only (tools/msl/check.py): what the Metal
// that shaderir/msl.c writes uses, typed as Metal types it, so that a name wrong, a type mismatched or a statement
// malformed is found on a machine with no Metal compiler. It is not Metal: the real check is Apple's compiler (CI).
